    1000           0.069           5
   10000           0.455          19
  100000           0.815          63
PASS  exploitation concentrates on the best arm as the budget grows   | 0.03 -> 0.81
PASS  c = 0 collapses to pure greed — one arm only   | the exploration constant is load-bearing, not decoration
PASS  and P-UCB is NOT UCB1 — the unvisited-arm bonus differs by an order of magnitude   | P-UCB 10.00 vs UCB1 0.86 at T=10k
